        "B": "Their superoxide dismutase inactivates neutrophil elastase",
        "C": "Their catalase destroys the H2O2 the phagocyte could borrow",
        "D": "Their IgA protease cleaves opsonizing antibody",
        "E": "They lack a cell wall and so resist lysozyme"
