      "topic": "C. tetani: tetanospasmin",
      "stem": "A 45-year-old farmer who has not had a booster in 25 years steps on a rusty nail. Ten days later he develops trismus, risus sardonicus, and spasms that arch his back, as shown. The toxin responsible inhibits release of which neurotransmitter, and from which cells?",
