      "stem": "A 25-year-old returns from Puerto Rico with high fever, severe retro-orbital headache, and intense joint and muscle pain ('breakbone fever'). Labs show leukopenia and thrombocytopenia, and a tourniquet test is positive. She had dengue 3 years ago. Why is her risk of severe dengue higher now?",
