      "stem": "A 30-year-old man dies of an encephalitis with agitation, hydrophobia (painful laryngeal spasms when drinking), and hypersalivation. Months earlier he found a bat in his bedroom. The brain at autopsy is shown, with eosinophilic cytoplasmic inclusions in neurons. How did the virus reach his CNS?",
