      "stem": "A 24-year-old woman has frothy, malodorous yellow-green discharge and vulvar itching. Vaginal pH is 6.0, and punctate cervical hemorrhages are seen. A stained specimen from culture is shown: pear-shaped trophozoites with anterior flagella and an undulating membrane. How should she be treated?",
