      "topic": "UTI organisms & urinalysis",
      "stem": "A 22-year-old woman has dysuria. Urinalysis shows leukocyte esterase positive and nitrite negative. Culture grows Gram-positive cocci in chains that are catalase-negative and grow in 6.5% NaCl. Why was the nitrite test negative?",
