      "difficulty": "hard",
      "topic": "Aspergillus: beta-D-glucan assay limitations",
      "stem": "A serum 1,3-beta-D-glucan assay is positive in a neutropenic patient being evaluated for a mold infection. The clinical team notes this test would remain negative if the culprit organism were a Mucorales species instead. Why?",
