      "stem": "A stool wet mount from a hiker with foul-smelling, greasy diarrhea after a backcountry camping trip shows a pear-shaped organism with two nuclei and four pairs of flagella that appears to tumble as it moves. Which structure is this organism using to attach to the duodenal mucosa?",
