      "topic": "Giardia: transmission and cyst form",
      "stem": "An outbreak of watery, non-bloody diarrhea occurs among people who drank untreated water from a mountain stream without boiling or filtering it first. Which form of the parasite in the water was responsible for establishing infection after ingestion?",
